  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bank Ipak Yuli Supporting Sustainable and Inclusive Access to Finance Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project provides a loan to Ipak Yuli Bank for onlending to MSMEs. At least 10% of the proceeds will be onlent for green financing, at 20% will be onlent to women-owned MSMEs, at least 60% will be onlent outside Tashkent.</narrative>
  </description>
